    "title": "Kaya's School Trip Plans",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a rainy, quite cloudy day.",
      "Kaya was reading an important animal book.",
      "Suddenly, her neighbor Hana called; her phone began to ring.",
      "\"Let's talk about our school trip!\" Hana said happily.",
      "\"We'll certainly fly by airplane,\" Kaya replied.",
      "\"They'll see a monkey and a zebra running forward.\"",
      "\"You'll climb to spot a koala or a clever fox.\"",
      "\"Maybe a small mouse, a sheep, or even a dolphin!\"",
      "\"She'll try dancing, not rugby or skating,\" Kaya added.",
      "\"We'll eat yummy curry, spaghetti, and corn,\" Hana exclaimed.",
      "\"They won't heat the octopus or raw cabbage,\" Kaya giggled.",
      "\"We mustn't forget to borrow warm hats,\" Hana added."
    ]
